WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:10.079
The big hand goes around.

2
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.485
It goes around every hour.

3
00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:19.964
The Earth turns around.

4
00:00:19.965 --> 00:00:29.939
It turns around every day.

5
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:36.270
The moon goes around the Earth.

6
00:00:36.271 --> 00:00:42.771
It goes around every month.

7
00:00:42.772 --> 00:00:50.048
The Earth goes around the sun.

8
00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:58.975
It goes around every year.
